.claude/worktrees/

# Scratch space: plans, corpora, throwaway probes. No trailing slash: a
# review worktree symlinks tmp to the primary checkout's, and "tmp/" matches
# directories only, so the symlink got committed (#197) and git then deleted
# the ignored corpus beneath it on checkout.
tmp

